{"id":"f3905418154c5f06","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-craig-propositional-interpolation.md","title":"Propositional Interpolation","display":"thm-craig-propositional-interpolation — Propositional Interpolation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-craig-propositional-interpolation","aliases":["28-thm-craig-propositional-interpolation"],"display":"thm-craig-propositional-interpolation — Propositional Interpolation","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 15.3 and proof","source_printed_pages":"311–312","source_pdf_pages":"337–338","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-craig-propositional-interpolation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-craig-propositional-interpolation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-craig-propositional-interpolation — Propositional Interpolation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 15.3 and proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"311–312"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"337–338"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi:\\{0,1\\}^{n+k}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\varphi:\\{0,1\\}^{n+k}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi:\\{0,1\\}^{m+k}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\psi:\\{0,1\\}^{m+k}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\">\\(x,y,z\\)</span> 分别取长度n,m,k的赋值。</li>\n<li>仅z坐标共享，x与y的坐标域互不相交；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lor,\\land,\\neg\">\\(\\lor,\\land,\\neg\\)</span> 为布尔运算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[\\forall x,y,z\\ \\varphi(x,z)\\lor\\psi(y,z)=1]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists I:\\{0,1\\}^k\\to\\{0,1\\}\\ \\forall x,y,z\\ [(\\varphi(x,z)\\lor I(z))\\land(\\psi(y,z)\\lor\\neg I(z))=1].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[\\forall x,y,z\\ \\varphi(x,z)\\lor\\psi(y,z)=1]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists I:\\{0,1\\}^k\\to\\{0,1\\}\\ \\forall x,y,z\\ [(\\varphi(x,z)\\lor I(z))\\land(\\psi(y,z)\\lor\\neg I(z))=1].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正向取I(z)=1当且仅当存在x使φ(x,z)=0。若I=0则φ对x恒真；若I=1，以一个假φ见证和原恒真析取推出ψ对全部y恒真。反向分别检查I=0和1即可。此证明只给函数存在性，未许诺紧凑电路。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 15.3 and proof；印刷页 311–312；PDF 页 337–338。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第15章的 Propositional Interpolation，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,m,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi:\\{0,1\\}^{n+k}\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi:\\{0,1\\}^{m+k}\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z","display":false},{"tex":"\\lor,\\land,\\neg","display":false},{"tex":"[\\forall x,y,z\\ \\varphi(x,z)\\lor\\psi(y,z)=1]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists I:\\{0,1\\}^k\\to\\{0,1\\}\\ \\forall x,y,z\\ [(\\varphi(x,z)\\lor I(z))\\land(\\psi(y,z)\\lor\\neg I(z))=1].","display":true}],"bytes":1705,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-352","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-frege-system]]、[[28-thm-craig-propositional-interpolation]]、[[28-thm-resolution-feasible-interpolation]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}